			<title_t><![CDATA[AI-Enhanced Custom Software Development]]></title_t>
			<text_t><![CDATA[We build custom web apps, internal tools, portals, integrations, and workflow systems with an AI-assisted delivery process. AI helps us move faster through discovery, implementation, refactoring, test generation, and documentation while senior engineering keeps the architecture clean and maintainable.]]></text_t>
